<StoryLayout title="Scratch BDX  workshop Light it up with Crumble" year={2015}>
  <p>A delivered a workshop at the international Scratch conference in Bordeaux (2017)</p>
      <p>I love using the <a href="http://redfernelectronics.co.uk/crumble/">crumble</a> board with all ages of students.  The board becomes the enabler for the projects and not the centre piece. It has a very simple and clean interface programmed with "scratch" like blocks.  We have made disco lights, miniture faire ground rides, drag cars and even motorised lego Creepers.</p>
